[00:18.66]Hi it's been a while
[00:23.89]Since the last time that I saw your smile
[00:31.86]What a perfect fit
[00:34.64]The last piece have fallen into it's place
[00:41.21]I've been craving to touch you
[00:44.69]Like moonlight stroking your face
[00:49.10]My dear reverie come hold me near
[00:56.71]Come dance with me in rosy haze of yesterday
[01:04.99]Reverie don't drift away
[01:10.74]Please keep me here in your warm embrace
[01:18.58]I'll trade anything
[01:22.00]For you for one more day
[01:55.27]I'll perfume your dreams
[02:00.49]With scent of flowers and summer breeze
[02:08.72]Does it matter if it's true
[02:14.12]It feels a lot more real
[02:17.99]When we whistle through the fields
[02:21.80]When I sing this song for you
[02:25.58]My dear reverie come hold me near
[02:33.45]Come dance with me in rosy haze of yesterday
[02:41.71]Reverie don't let me go
[02:47.79]If sanity means I have to hit the road
[02:54.87]Then I don't wanna know anywhere the wind blows